==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3~10.67 seconds<sup>90f~320f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 3~10.67 seconds<sup>90f~320f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Metal One Horn may seem extremely strong at first, with the ability to take only 1 damage from non-[[Critical Hit|Critical]] attacks, but his HP and range are pitiful. Simply bring any [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]] and [[:Category:Anti-Metal Cats|anti-Metals]] you have and a few attackers for the Gories; even [[Moneko (Special Cat)|Miss Moneko]] is enough to defeat him, though it may take several attempts.

